          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na namwĩa mũlaĩka ũla waneenaa nakwa, Ii nĩ myaũ? Na anzũngĩa, Ii nĩ mbya ila syanyaĩĩkisye Yuta, na Isilaeli, na Yelusaleme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova ambon’ya atwii ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo naisye, Aa mooka kwĩka ata? Na anzũngĩa, ambĩa, Ii nĩ mbya ila syanyaĩĩkisye Yuta, mũvaka vatyaĩ mũndũ waaũkĩlya mũtwe; ĩndĩ ii nĩsyooka kũmatĩsya, kwĩkya mbya sya i mbaĩ nthĩ, ila syookĩlilye ũvya wasyo ĩũlũ wa nthĩ ya Yuta imĩnyaĩĩkye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.21"
            ]
